+## 2026-11-03
+- **Export files are named after the Singapore day** ([#63](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/63)). The reconciled export used to be named after the server's UTC date, so an export made at 07:30 on 1 December in Singapore was called `reconciled-2026-11-30.csv`, which looked like the wrong month. The file name now uses the Singapore calendar day. The contents of the file are unchanged.
+
